{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ChessFinity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChessFinity is a collection of chess variants built for <strong>3D boards</strong> and experimental rulesets \u2014 from classic 3D chess to weird new layouts, strange pieces, and mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/e0b97952bac587b9b79c430075c91d91.poster.avif?t=1773668275\" width=700 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/e0b97952bac587b9b79c430075c91d91.webm?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/e0b97952bac587b9b79c430075c91d91.mp4?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a preset and play immediately, or dive into <strong>Mana Chess</strong>, a deckbuilding mode where your pieces come from a deck and you spend mana to deploy them.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Mana Chess deckbuilding</strong> (pieces as cards + mana to deploy)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D chess variants</strong> on unusual boards (including classic variants)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Strange new pieces</strong> and wild matchups</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-games:</strong> puzzles + routing/touring challenges + chaotic FFA modes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>solo</strong> vs <strong>AI</strong>, <strong>hot-seat</strong>, and <strong>multiplayer</strong> (still improving)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mana Chess: deckbuilding meets chess</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Mana Chess, you don\u2019t start with a fixed army \u2014 you build a <strong>deck of pieces</strong> and deploy them using mana. It creates a very different type of chess: more tactical surprises, more comeback potential, and a lot more variety between games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/ac4e6b7762244693112ef69945bc7bc2.poster.avif?t=1773668275\" width=700 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/ac4e6b7762244693112ef69945bc7bc2.webm?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/ac4e6b7762244693112ef69945bc7bc2.mp4?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mana highlights:</strong><br><br><br></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose from <strong>mana presets</strong> (single level or multiple levels, with or without walls)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a <strong>deck</strong> that includes powerful new pieces</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Place pieces by spending mana and play with configurable limits (including <strong>moves per turn</strong> \u2014 up to 3 in Mana)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set <strong>king placement</strong> and <strong>deployment zones</strong> for custom Mana scenarios</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3D chess variants &amp; weird boards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChessFinity includes curated 3D presets and variants \u2014 some well-known, some deliberately strange.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/52e571f3bfcd9173cccd25513795ba41.poster.avif?t=1773668275\" width=700 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/52e571f3bfcd9173cccd25513795ba41.webm?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/52e571f3bfcd9173cccd25513795ba41.mp4?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Examples you\u2019ll find inside:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Classic 3D variants</strong>\u00a0like <strong>Raumschach</strong></i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New variants and experimental boards (small boards, long boards, boards with holes, \u201cbridge\u201d layouts, walled layouts)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenario-style rulesets (for example: king with only pawns, king with only bishops, asymmetric matchups like dragon vs knights)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strange new pieces</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond standard chess pieces, ChessFinity includes new piece types designed to work with multi-level boards and variant rulesets \u2014 creating threats and tactics you won\u2019t see in normal chess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/f8a1d574dab6244c7fda8383aa10265d.poster.avif?t=1773668275\" width=700 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/f8a1d574dab6244c7fda8383aa10265d.webm?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/f8a1d574dab6244c7fda8383aa10265d.mp4?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini-games &amp; challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want something faster, weirder, or more puzzle-like than a full match?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>3D chess puzzles</strong></i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Routing &amp; touring</strong> challenges</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic FFA modes</strong> \u2014 including rule sets where the board can \u201crot\u201d (disappear) as players move</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/f0b1e23aa40df9b93c766bbc2fd1da3f.poster.avif?t=1773668275\" width=700 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/f0b1e23aa40df9b93c766bbc2fd1da3f.webm?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/f0b1e23aa40df9b93c766bbc2fd1da3f.mp4?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play modes (and a quick note on multiplayer)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Solo</strong> vs yourself or AI</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3+ players</strong> options (including team formats like <strong>2v2</strong>)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online multiplayer</strong> is available, but it\u2019s still being improved \u2014 if you want the smoothest experience right now, solo vs AI / hot-seat is the best starting point.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom games (limited, single-player focused)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChessFinity includes custom setup tools, with limits (and currently focused on solo play).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you can customise:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Board shape &amp; size</strong>\u00a0</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose mode: <strong>Modded</strong> Chess or <strong>Mana</strong> Chess</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Piece placement</strong> for Modded Chess</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>King placement</strong> + deployment zones for Mana Chess</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Number of players</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time limit per turn</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Move limits per turn (Mana: up to 3)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck building (Mana only)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UI &amp; quality-of-life tools</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tutorials for Mana, 3D chess, and basic board control</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move log + match replay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Check piece movement patterns and threatened positions</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between 2D and 3D views</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Board coordinates</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust spacing between levels for better visibility on tall boards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Wishlist ChessFinity on Steam</strong></u> to follow development and be notified when major updates (including the demo) go live.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3268290?t=1773668275","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3268290?t=1773668275","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/ffe44eccd618b9e2331601e0da4e3a2135c2de04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773668275","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/ffe44eccd618b9e2331601e0da4e3a2135c2de04/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773668275","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3463010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ChessFinity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChessFinity is a collection of chess variants built for <strong>3D boards</strong> and experimental rulesets \u2014 from classic 3D chess to weird new layouts, strange pieces, and mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/e0b97952bac587b9b79c430075c91d91.poster.avif?t=1773668275\" width=700 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/e0b97952bac587b9b79c430075c91d91.webm?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/e0b97952bac587b9b79c430075c91d91.mp4?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a preset and play immediately, or dive into <strong>Mana Chess</strong>, a deckbuilding mode where your pieces come from a deck and you spend mana to deploy them.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Mana Chess deckbuilding</strong> (pieces as cards + mana to deploy)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D chess variants</strong> on unusual boards (including classic variants)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Strange new pieces</strong> and wild matchups</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-games:</strong> puzzles + routing/touring challenges + chaotic FFA modes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>solo</strong> vs <strong>AI</strong>, <strong>hot-seat</strong>, and <strong>multiplayer</strong> (still improving)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mana Chess: deckbuilding meets chess</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Mana Chess, you don\u2019t start with a fixed army \u2014 you build a <strong>deck of pieces</strong> and deploy them using mana. It creates a very different type of chess: more tactical surprises, more comeback potential, and a lot more variety between games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/ac4e6b7762244693112ef69945bc7bc2.poster.avif?t=1773668275\" width=700 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/ac4e6b7762244693112ef69945bc7bc2.webm?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/ac4e6b7762244693112ef69945bc7bc2.mp4?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mana highlights:</strong><br><br><br></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose from <strong>mana presets</strong> (single level or multiple levels, with or without walls)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a <strong>deck</strong> that includes powerful new pieces</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Place pieces by spending mana and play with configurable limits (including <strong>moves per turn</strong> \u2014 up to 3 in Mana)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set <strong>king placement</strong> and <strong>deployment zones</strong> for custom Mana scenarios</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3D chess variants &amp; weird boards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChessFinity includes curated 3D presets and variants \u2014 some well-known, some deliberately strange.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/52e571f3bfcd9173cccd25513795ba41.poster.avif?t=1773668275\" width=700 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/52e571f3bfcd9173cccd25513795ba41.webm?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/52e571f3bfcd9173cccd25513795ba41.mp4?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Examples you\u2019ll find inside:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Classic 3D variants</strong>\u00a0like <strong>Raumschach</strong></i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New variants and experimental boards (small boards, long boards, boards with holes, \u201cbridge\u201d layouts, walled layouts)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenario-style rulesets (for example: king with only pawns, king with only bishops, asymmetric matchups like dragon vs knights)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strange new pieces</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond standard chess pieces, ChessFinity includes new piece types designed to work with multi-level boards and variant rulesets \u2014 creating threats and tactics you won\u2019t see in normal chess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/f8a1d574dab6244c7fda8383aa10265d.poster.avif?t=1773668275\" width=700 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/f8a1d574dab6244c7fda8383aa10265d.webm?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/f8a1d574dab6244c7fda8383aa10265d.mp4?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini-games &amp; challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want something faster, weirder, or more puzzle-like than a full match?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>3D chess puzzles</strong></i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Routing &amp; touring</strong> challenges</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic FFA modes</strong> \u2014 including rule sets where the board can \u201crot\u201d (disappear) as players move</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/f0b1e23aa40df9b93c766bbc2fd1da3f.poster.avif?t=1773668275\" width=700 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/f0b1e23aa40df9b93c766bbc2fd1da3f.webm?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/f0b1e23aa40df9b93c766bbc2fd1da3f.mp4?t=1773668275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play modes (and a quick note on multiplayer)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Solo</strong> vs yourself or AI</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3+ players</strong> options (including team formats like <strong>2v2</strong>)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online multiplayer</strong> is available, but it\u2019s still being improved \u2014 if you want the smoothest experience right now, solo vs AI / hot-seat is the best starting point.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom games (limited, single-player focused)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChessFinity includes custom setup tools, with limits (and currently focused on solo play).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you can customise:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Board shape &amp; size</strong>\u00a0</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose mode: <strong>Modded</strong> Chess or <strong>Mana</strong> Chess</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Piece placement</strong> for Modded Chess</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>King placement</strong> + deployment zones for Mana Chess</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Number of players</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time limit per turn</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Move limits per turn (Mana: up to 3)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck building (Mana only)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UI &amp; quality-of-life tools</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tutorials for Mana, 3D chess, and basic board control</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move log + match replay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Check piece movement patterns and threatened positions</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between 2D and 3D views</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Board coordinates</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust spacing between levels for better visibility on tall boards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Wishlist ChessFinity on Steam</strong></u> to follow development and be notified when major updates (including the demo) go live.</p>","developers":["Chessfinity"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/dae3da7552a528ef3f6cdbd78736081b0f4b80cc/header.jpg?t=1773668275","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong